  "descriptionHtml": "<div>Rose gold-tone stainless steel case and bracelet. Fixed rose gold-tone stainless steel bezel. Rose gold-tone dial with rose gold-tone hands and index-Arabic numeral hour markers. Minute markers around the outer rim. Dial Type: Analog. Date display between 4 and 5 o'clock position. Quartz movement. Scratch resistant mineral crystal. Solid case back. Round case shape, case size: 38 mm. Deployment with push button release clasp. Water resistant at 30 meters / 100 feet. Functions: chronograph, date, hour, minute, second. Runway Series. Casual watch style. Michael Kors Runway Chronograph Quartz Rose Gold Dial Watch MK7324.</div>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600;\">Technical Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n    <tbody>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Brand</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Michael Kors</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Series</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Runway</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Model</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">MK7324</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Gender</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Women's</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Movement</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Quartz</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"